## 💡 Key Takeaways

- Conditional Access is the foundation of Zero Trust
- Report-only mode allows safe evaluation before enforcement
- Break-glass accounts prevent accidental lockouts
- Legacy authentication bypasses MFA and must be blocked
- Sign-in logs are essential for verifying policy behavior
